            <select id="sagPickCase" onchange="sagPickCase()" style="max-width:100%;margin-bottom:4px;"></select>
            <select id="sagPickBha" style="max-width:100%;margin-bottom:4px;"></select>
            <div class="brow"><button class="btn btn-g" onclick="sagPickImport()">Import (replaces the table)</button><button class="btn btn-g" onclick="document.getElementById('sagPick').style.display='none'">Cancel</button></div>
            <p class="hint" id="sagPickNote">All rows of the case BHA are imported (also the ones unticked / beyond the SAG length limit — T&amp;D needs the full string). Empty weights are filled from OD/ID × steel density.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="libPick" style="display:none;margin:6px 0;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);">
            <div class="fg" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr))">
              <div><label>Category</label><select id="libCat" onchange="libPickCat()"></select></div>
              <div style="grid-column:span 2"><label>Item</label><select id="libItem" onchange="libPickItem()"></select></div>
              <div><label id="lLibLen">Length (m)</label><input type="number" id="libLen" step="any"/></div>
              <div><label>Add to</label><select id="libTarget"><option value="bha">BHA table</option><option value="dp">Drill Pipe table</option></select></div>
            </div>
            <div class="brow"><button class="btn btn-g" onclick="libPickAdd()">+ Add on top</button><button class="btn btn-g" onclick="document.getElementById('libPick').style.display='none'">Close</button></div>
            <p class="hint" id="libNote"></p>
            <p class="hint">Catalogue: public/data/bhaLibrary.json (dimensions converted from Hydraulics.xls — DC, HWDP, DP, SWDP, MWD, motors). Adds single components; complete BHAs per area can be added later as saved templates.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="hint">List bottom-up: Bit first, then up to DP. OD/ID always in mm. Import <strong>replaces</strong> the whole table below — export first if you want to keep the current one.</p>
          <!-- Drill pipe per run (added 2026-11-08) -->
          <div class="inputs-ttl" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:12px">Drill Pipe above the BHA — editing run</div>
          <div class="tbl-wrap">
            <table class="dt">
              <thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>OD (mm)</th><th>ID (mm)</th><th id="th_dlen">Length (m)</th><th id="th_dwt">Wt (kg/m)</th><th></th></tr></thead>
              <tbody id="dpBody"></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div class="brow"><button class="btn btn-g" onclick="addDP()">+ Drill Pipe</button></div>
          <p class="hint">Bottom-up, starting right above the BHA (e.g. HWDP, then DP; tapered strings: one row per size). The <strong>top row is extended to surface</strong>, so its length only matters if it is not the top. Leave empty to keep the old behaviour (the BHA table above holds the whole string; anything above it is a default 114.3 mm / 41.2 kg/m DP).</p>
        </div>
