            <div class="brow">
              <button class="btn btn-g" style="font-size:9px" onclick="loadExEDR()">Load Example EDR</button>
            </div>
            <div class="brow">
              <button class="btn btn-cal" id="btnUseDMEdr" onclick="useDrillingMechanicsEDR()" disabled>📊 Use Saved Hook Load Data (Drilling Mechanics)</button>
            </div>
            <p class="hint" id="dmEdrHint">Load a Job (section 00) first — if that job already has a Hook Load vs Measured Depth plot saved in Drilling Mechanics, this reuses it instead of re-uploading the same CSV.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
